---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-white/10 bg-slate-950/75">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-6 py-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr]">
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sky-300">Anusha Dharmasena</p>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-slate-400">
        Personal site rebuild in Astro — centred on products, writing, and practical engineering work rather than a dated single-page résumé.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:text-right">
      <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">© {year} Anusha Dharmasena.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Built with Astro, content collections, and a static-first workflow.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
